OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther showers over the Derbyshire
OL,7,Fhills this evening and overnight.
OL,8,FElsewhere, it will be mostly dry with
OL,9,Fclear spells. Winds easing to become
OL,10,Flight inland, but remaining breezy
OL,11,Fnear the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FStaying cloudy with the odd
OL,14,Flight shower over western hills
OL,15,Fhowever elsewhere will be mostly dry
OL,16,Fwith bright or sunny spells. Moderate
OL,17,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
